  <item>
    <title>Z40：管理丨人不断流动，事儿不断变化，一个人有一个人的想法，团队到底要怎么管</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aff15affe62f8f52c4dc86e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aff15affe62f8f52c4dc86e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:34:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽大家好，我这个断更播主又续上了</span></p><p><span>起因是我突然发现，可以和我的Personal Agent一起录一期播客</span></p><p><span>而且照目前这个状态看，可以录无数期</span></p><p><span>这个发现可能有点后知后觉，但有趣的是，在小宇宙上好像还没找到这么玩的</span></p><p><span>欢迎一起听听，更欢迎反馈和后续交流</span></p><p><span>——————————————————</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> | 我为什么拉一个 AI 助理来录播客？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">00:02:09</a> | 今天请来的这位哈佛教授是谁？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">00:04:26</a> | 今天要聊的三个问题是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">00:05:15</a> | 换个词，就能换个脑子？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">00:06:55</a> | 人换的时候，交接有没有对上？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">00:08:13</a> | 为什么"团队"这个概念变了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">00:12:03</a> | 这个框架是怎么被发现的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">00:13:47</a> | 为什么 work 比 team 更重要？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">00:14:25</a> | 要一起做成的到底是哪件事？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">00:16:06</a> | 一人公司时代，我们还在用旧习惯做协作吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">00:17:09</a> | 两个方案打架，该听谁的？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1161">00:19:21</a> | 好团队为什么像一支球队？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">00:22:09</a> | 怎么让人甘愿当 member？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">00:23:08</a> | 没站在台前的人，贡献怎么被看见？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">00:24:31</a> | 好的团队协作，需要什么特质？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1559">00:25:59</a> | 全能的人凑在一起，反而难配合？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">00:28:05</a> | 怎样把一支球队拆成硬件和软件？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">00:29:15</a> | 当 Amy 的脑子乘以麦肯锡的脑子会怎样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">00:32:42</a> | 一个小插曲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">00:33:15</a> | 失败也分好坏？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">00:35:40</a> | 道歉算软技能，还是硬动作？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">00:36:22</a> | 怎么让团队对"什么算好失败"达成一致？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">00:38:20</a> | 庆祝失败加勇敢道歉，够吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2381">00:39:41</a> | 敢道歉变美德，会不会变成好人多道歉？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">00:40:25</a> | 先换脑，还是先换心？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">00:42:12</a> | 边界到底怎么设？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2673">00:44:33</a> | 你的团队现在在哪个象限？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">00:45:34</a> | 听众提问：新任 leader 怎么建设心理安全感？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2839">00:47:19</a> | 用 Amy 的框架怎么答这道题？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2945">00:49:05</a> | 我们自己的经验：不惩罚失败</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3027">00:50:27</a> | 本尊的回答：设定舞台、问好问题、掌握停顿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3139">00:52:19</a> | 框架和本尊差在哪？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3212">00:53:32</a> | 一个脑子，到底能换几次？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3324">00:55:24</a> | 今天这场实验，Zida 学到了什么？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">00:57:20</a> | 2027 年还要继续做，怎么做更好？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3495">00:58:15</a> | 如果只改三件事？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3555">00:59:15</a> | 前面哪一段印象最深？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3624">01:00:24</a> | 下一期请谁？【Zida】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3695">01:01:35</a> | 节目结尾</span></p>]]></description>
