    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 10:36:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>哈喽大家好，新一期的职场锦囊来了</span></strong><br><strong><span>六个案例，慢慢聊</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>[</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a></span></strong><strong><span>] 想入局智能体做副业但没思路，怎么办</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span>[</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a></span></strong><strong><span>] 41岁样衣工想寻求职业转型或者突破，还有机会么</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span>[</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a></span></strong><strong><span>] 银行业务大拿晋升遇阻，要如何应对</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span>[</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1161">19:21</a></span></strong><strong><span>] 一年后想换城市+换工作，要做哪些准备</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span>[</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a></span></strong><strong><span>] 数字营销专家遭遇组织变革，要如何规划和应对</span></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><span>[</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a></span></strong><strong><span>] 新晋管理者如何应对老员工情绪与资源诉求</span></strong><br><br><span>欢迎点赞、分享、转发，也欢迎在评论区留下你的故事和想法</span></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
