    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello，欢迎来到随聊桌</span><br><span>真是好久好久好久好久不见</span><br><span>我发现如果再不更新</span><br><span>就要变成年庚播主或者断更播主了</span><br><span>这一切都要感谢《狗神》</span><br><span>一部让我感受到触动、震撼甚至洗礼的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span>很多人说狗神是小丑+教父+汪汪队立大功</span><br><span>我觉得这么说不太合适</span><br><span>至少狗神和小丑是完全不同的两部电影</span></p><span></span><h2><span>ShowNotes：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Intro</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 为什么我对这部电影如此钟情</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 为什么我觉得狗神不等于小丑+教父+汪汪队立大功</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 为什么我觉得观看狗神是一种洗礼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 狗神和小丑有什么不同</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;狗神命运中遇到的三轮拯救 </span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;狗神命运中得到的四种善意</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 狗神中我比较喜欢的句子（欢迎补充）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>延伸</span><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/6586f7e8000000001600575a" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/6586f7e8000000001600575a"><span>1. 挑战三秒让狗哭</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/657f1daf00000000380159b1" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/657f1daf00000000380159b1"><span>2. 猫手在上原则失败合集</span></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Wherever there's a misfortune, God sends dogs.</span></p>]]></description>
