  <item>
    <title>Z28：想法丨我们能从小米发布会中学到什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e21847e490c5dee5f7303b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e21847e490c5dee5f7303b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Aug 2023 13:42:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello，欢迎来到随聊桌</span><br><span>好久不见（其实也就三周哈哈）</span><br><span>最近忙搬家、忙入职、忙适应</span><br><span>本以为还会再拖延一阵子</span><br><span>结果本周小米的发布会再一次点燃了我表达的欲望</span><br><span>以至于哪怕是大小周的我，也一定要在周日这个节点</span><br><span>把这一期做出来，希望你能喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span>INTRO <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我们为什么还要看发布会 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我们要怎么看一场发布会（纯个人看法） <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fudly1q2-VDrgCBZ019MzLcnEAY5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>人——我们能从雷军身上学到什么 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a></span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①为什么我相信雷军真的愿意向他人学习</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;②为什么我更倾向认为雷军是营销大师而非产品大师</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③面对小米战略的调整，雷军要如何应对</span></p><span></span><p><span>产品——小米剑指高端，10分你打几分 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a></span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①小米冲击高端三要素——工艺、材质、AI</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;②为什么我觉得小米在高端材质的传播上用错了力</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③为什么我觉得拥抱AI甚至植入AI不等于高端</span></p><span></span><p><span>方法——小米定义的冲击高端方法论 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a></span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①小米的高端三原则</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmmH5dzafNS5avydOYaKeB5hCX7m.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>②为什么从参数到体验是小米的自我迭代</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③打造高端的马拉松是什么样的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHNRXhMsWbygVrYz_WifagEHC6X.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>④为什么单纯关联价格和材质会出bug</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqSIOwNHkmEjUKbKDZSTYURpY1oZ.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>⑤高端之路隐藏的工作还有哪些</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmY_8mKQTS-Rg3oKGUnKYt6NI2vp.PNG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjdHHysGrWjwuFjz-bw-7RyxjG7J.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>道理——让我觉得最有共鸣的金句 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>好了，这可能是史上最干的一起随聊桌</span><br><span>感谢你听到这里，欢迎评论区互动交流</span><br><span>我们，下回聊</span></p>]]></description>
